[b]RGO Harmony Expanded 0.1.0[/b]

Adds Fruits Expanded RGO values at 949 shared locations where Harmony matches Vanilla and at all 67 approved three-way RGO conflicts. Applies the user-selected RGO values for all 71 Harmony-fruit locations, including three that retain generic fruit on the map because Just Goods assigns sulfur at startup. Keeps the base Harmony map and More Locations data and preserves Just Goods 1.1 fixed-location effects.
